<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Happy Birthday My Love 🎂💕</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffdde1, #ee9ca7);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 3em;
      margin-top: 50px;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px #ff6699;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.3em;
      margin: 20px auto;
      width: 80%;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    button {
      background: #ff6699;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      font-size: 1.2em;
      border-radius: 25px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    button:hover {
      background: #ff3366;
    }

    #surprise {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 1.5em;
      animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {opacity: 0;}
      to {opacity: 1;}
    }

    /* Floating hearts */
    .heart {
      position: fixed;
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      background: pink;
      transform: rotate(45deg);
      animation: float 6s linear infinite;
    }

    .heart::before,
    .heart::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      background: pink;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .heart::before {
      top: -10px;
      left: 0;
    }

    .heart::after {
      left: -10px;
      top: 0;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      from {transform: translateY(100vh) rotate(45deg);}
      to {transform: translateY(-10vh) rotate(45deg);}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>🎉 Happy Birthday, My Love! 🎉</h1>
  <p>
    Even though we’re miles apart, I hope this little surprise makes you feel
    how close you are to my heart 💕
  </p>

  <button onclick="showSurprise()">Click for a surprise 🎁</button>

  <div id="surprise">
    💌 You are my favorite person in the whole world.  
    I’m so lucky to call you mine.  
    Here’s to many more birthdays together! 🥰
  </div>

  <script>
    // Floating hearts
    function createHeart() {
      const heart = document.createElement("div");
      heart.classList.add("heart");
      heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
      heart.style.animationDuration = (3 + Math.random() * 3) + "s";
      document.body.appendChild(heart);
      setTimeout(() => {
        heart.remove();
      }, 6000);
    }
    setInterval(createHeart, 500);

    // Surprise message
    function showSurprise() {
      document.getElementById("surprise").style.display = "block";
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
